            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Repair the leak, park over a drip pan or containment mat until then, and seal the slab. A penetrating silane or siloxane sealer slows absorption enough that you can blot a spill before it sets, while an epoxy or polyaspartic coating gives a surface that wipes clean. Keep absorbent and degreaser on hand so drips get treated within the hour."
